app purchase includes 500 coins, usable for tickets worth 500 coins. Additional coins can be purchased in VR as needed.\n\nCROSSIA is currently available as a beta version. Experiences, characters, and features may be added or updated over time.", "short_description": "CROSSIA Beta is a ticket-based Web & XR entertainment platform where fans can step into the worlds of their favorite anime, manga, illustration, and VTuber characters, and enjoy immersive experiences such as VR photo sessions and autograph events. This is the XR version of CROSSIA."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.gakugeki.biz/en/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.gakugeki.biz/en/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Gakugeki Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.gakugeki.biz/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2687655338230691"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ja"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28001372486193563"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623601_26574740198893949_767464938231577622_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ByOa3UGRgvQQ7kNvwHiJZfT&_nc_oc=AdoVvcpYv1VAG-Bu-UY61EVcEG9Dev9q3iPCvZfAdlcffvlPii6mdIPddzakZ0LRJkk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQJGiR94scaGEBnu29xJOpxQa0REQGvrhj